meta {
  name: Get Current User (API Key)
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/users/me
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{apiKey}}
}

docs {
  # Get Current User (API Key)
  
  Giống "Get Current User" nhưng dùng API Key thay vì JWT.
  
  **Authentication:** API Key (format `ecom_xxx`)
  
  ## Headers
  ```
  Authorization: Bearer ecom_your_api_key_here
  ```
  
  ## Response 200
  ```json
  {
    "id": 1,
    "email": "admin@ecom.com",
    "name": "Admin",
    "authMethod": "api_key"
  }
  ```
  
  > Lưu ý `authMethod` sẽ là `"api_key"` thay vì `"jwt"`.
}
